{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警務處葵青警區特別職務隊和反三合會行動組，昨晚（14日）在葵涌一幢工業中心搗破一個德州撲克賭檔，檢獲大批籌碼，總共拘捕9男1女。據了解，現場</p><p>據了解，現場為葵涌華星街8號華達工業中心，涉事賭檔在上址一個工廈劏房單位營運。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131750617392484352736904.jpeg/l2AD_E7zpjBw-RfXkutWS4cNh9pdjoe61kCqHuxAqh4\" alt=\"警方拘捕多人。（李家傑攝）\"><figcaption>警方拘捕多人。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131750614498283520827460.jpeg/nwcOlvYgRU9DB2qKJzXMg4ZOJMNmqmgz0eUu7-vlLu8\" alt=\"警方拘捕多人。（李家傑攝）\"><figcaption>警方拘捕多人。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131750620005666816793641.jpeg/0ylam5gJT5nRlrDixIPQx1Ykp1GWFpm_SXyL0nN8i9I\" alt=\"現場葵涌華星街8號華達工業中心。（李家傑攝）\"><figcaption>現場葵涌華星街8號華達工業中心。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T16:31:16.030406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}